  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We know, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mtext>&#8201;K.E.=</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> K.E. is same for all particle and magnetic field B is also some.<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />For proton: <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />For electron: <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />For Helium nuclei: <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
